  "content": "\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>Добавлена совместимость между Eating Animations и предметами еды из мода Twilight Forest, а также с отдельными вариантами из расширений в тематике Twilight Forest.</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>Совместимость для текстурного пакета Bundle</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/eating-animation-more-mod-compatibility\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Eating Animations More Mod Compatibility[NEO/FORGE]</a> &amp; <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/eating-animation-more-mod-compatibility-fabric\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">[FABRIC]</a></strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/eating-animation-more-mod-compatibility\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><em><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/1751/483/639114741005949896.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"153\" height=\"153\"></em></a><em><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/eating-animation-more-mod-compatibility-fabric\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/1748/995/639113051020661900.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"153\" height=\"153\"></a></em></p>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><em><strong>Частичная совместимость с другими модами:</strong></em></span></h3>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/eating-animations-quark-compatibility\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1223426/description_65ecc468-d6a5-423e-ac32-fbe1473e2593.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"128\" height=\"128\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/eating-animations-aether-compatibility\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1223426/description_7267a975-bbd6-4866-b7d0-204852d47d23.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"128\" height=\"128\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/eating-animations-x-born-in-chaos\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1223426/description_279b593b-ff8e-4bf2-9f54-fdc3f6ea86b0.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"128\" height=\"128\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/eating-animations-x-farmers-delight-add-ons\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/1529/920/638993640361607660.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"128\" height=\"128\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/eating-animations-x-twilight-forest\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/1772/708/639126112161736473.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"128\" height=\"128\"></a></p>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div style=\"width:300px;font-size:13px\">\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p><strong>Добавляет совместимость для модов с <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/eating-animation-forge\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Eating Animations (NEO/FORGE)</a> &amp;&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/eating-animation-fabric\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">(FABRIC)</a> или <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/modefite-item-definition-backport\" rel=\"nofollow\">Modefite</a></strong></p>\n<h3><strong>Совместимость с модами:</strong></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/the-twilight-forest\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Twilight Forest</a> &amp; <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/the-twilight-forest-unofficial\" rel=\"nofollow\">[Fork]</a></strong></li>\n<li><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/twilights-flavors-delight\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Twilight's Flavors &amp; Delight</a> </strong></li>\n<li><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/twilight-delight\" rel=\"nofollow\">Twilight Delight</a></strong></li>\n<li><strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252ftwilight-forest-artifacts\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Twilight Forest Artifacts</a></strong></li>\n</ul>\n<h3><strong>Поддерживаемые версии:</strong></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>1.16.x, </strong><strong>1.17.x, </strong><strong>1.18.x,&nbsp;</strong><strong>1.19.x,&nbsp;</strong><strong>1.20.x,&nbsp;</strong><strong>1.21.x</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1523334/description_7e4c4d0e-3aa1-44f0-b69e-bf6cce403daf.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"648\" height=\"378\"></strong></p>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div style=\"width:300px;font-size:13px\">\n<div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
